<title>USA: Foodarama Q1 shr $0.13 vs $0.41.</title>
<headline>Foodarama Q1 shr $0.13 vs $0.41.</headline>
<dateline>FREEHOLD, N.J. 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.13		    $0.41</p>
<p> Net			    176			496</p>
<p> Revs		     163,356		  146,303</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Results for quarters ended Feb 1, 1997 and Jan 27, 1996.</p>
<p>Earnings before interest, taxes, depreciation and amortization (EBITDA) were $3.9 million in Q1 1997 and $4.3 million in Q1 1996.</p>
<p>Same store sales in Q1 1997 increased 2.2 percent over the year-earlier period.</p>
<p>Full name of company is Foodarama Supsermarkets Inc</p>
